      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: "I don't know what kind of Pok\xE9mon he has for you, but you should
        go check it out anyway!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: If you end up deciding to go on an adventure or something, I'll be there
        with you! In spirit, that is.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[4]'
